{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I love you! You're so special to me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But these other girls... they keep looking at you. They want to steal you away. I can\u2019t let that happen. I won\u2019t let that happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723650/extras/d81273240804beb5293d1ea210acc668.avif?t=1768099117\" width=1136 height=482 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So why would you go? After all I've done, why do you resist?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0~\u00a0You're mine. Forever!</strong></i>\u00a0<i><strong>~</strong></i>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723650/extras/db6a8779446d3998d6c13a7507ced3ab.avif?t=1768099117\" width=1560 height=788 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00abYandere Sacrifice\u00bb</strong> is a first-person <strong>Survival Horror</strong> game. You\u2019re the object of affection for all the girls at school\u2014but one of them is a Yandere. She\u2019s plotting to kidnap you under cover of darkness, and it\u2019s up to you to find a way to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game delivers a unique blend of gameplay, weaving together fitting mechanics into something truly distinct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features include</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Enemy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Yandere learns from your actions, studying your tactics to hunt you down more effectively with every encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Environment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire location shifts, generating a new layout each time you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anime-inspired graphics bring expressive visual effects to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D Sound</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself with realistic audio through a dynamic sound reflection system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your experience deepens and changes as you progress.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3723650?t=1768099117","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723650/16282f16451cdadba722c6d673db99feffcbd89c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768099117","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723650/171714d5a747f0ce22bee1a5add510c59ab04b91/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768099117","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723650/171714d5a747f0ce22bee1a5add510c59ab04b91/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768099117","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"- The game contains murder scenes, also present: blood, corpses, dismemberment"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I love you! You're so special to me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But these other girls... they keep looking at you. They want to steal you away. I can\u2019t let that happen. I won\u2019t let that happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723650/extras/d81273240804beb5293d1ea210acc668.avif?t=1768099117\" width=1136 height=482 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So why would you go? After all I've done, why do you resist?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0~\u00a0You're mine. Forever!</strong></i>\u00a0<i><strong>~</strong></i>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723650/extras/db6a8779446d3998d6c13a7507ced3ab.avif?t=1768099117\" width=1560 height=788 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00abYandere Sacrifice\u00bb</strong> is a first-person <strong>Survival Horror</strong> game. You\u2019re the object of affection for all the girls at school\u2014but one of them is a Yandere. She\u2019s plotting to kidnap you under cover of darkness, and it\u2019s up to you to find a way to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game delivers a unique blend of gameplay, weaving together fitting mechanics into something truly distinct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features include</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Enemy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Yandere learns from your actions, studying your tactics to hunt you down more effectively with every encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Environment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire location shifts, generating a new layout each time you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anime-inspired graphics bring expressive visual effects to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D Sound</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself with realistic audio through a dynamic sound reflection system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your experience deepens and changes as you progress.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Flawe"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamst